// Player interacts with hammer on the dinner table
title: D21S1
---
BZZTT
You: Must be Peeko.
Peeko: Heeyyyy! Are you awake yet?!!
Peeko: You haven't opened my app for three days! I missed you! I was lonely! 
Peeko: How could you ever do that to me?!
Peeko: Well...enough talking, you have to help me now!! 
You: Help you...how? What was the weird message even about?
Peeko: What did you not understand about it?! 
Peeko: It clearly spelled 'LET ME OUT' so that's what you need to do. 
[i]You stared at your phone screen dumbfounded.[/i]
You: Peeko...you're a virtual pet. I- how could I possibly let you out.
// ANGRY PEEKO ANIMATION
[i]Peeko's face visibly became angrier.[/i]
