Peeko: I have been trying to fuse our minds together, in preparation for the last step. 
You: Fuse our minds? You've been messing with my brain?
Peeko: It's all for the good of our friendship, trust me. 

Peeko: [b]Let me take over your body, that way we can be together forever.[/b]
Peeko: [b]We'll never have to be apart again.[/b]
You:
->Oh...that sounds nice. I won't have to be lonely again, because I'll always have you Peeko.
